1
00:00:00,815 --> 00:00:01,855
[DOOR CLOSES]

2
00:00:02,025 --> 00:00:03,445
ALL:
Ah.

3
00:00:03,693 --> 00:00:05,613
(Howard:)Hey, you know
what would be a great idea?

4
00:00:05,779 --> 00:00:10,369
(Howard:)We get some girls over here
and play Laser Obstacle Strip Chess.

5
00:00:11,034 --> 00:00:15,664
Believe me, any girl willing to play that,
you don't wanna see naked.

6
00:00:17,207 --> 00:00:19,207
(Howard:)You underestimate me.

7
00:00:26,299 --> 00:00:27,339
(Sheldon:)Penny.

8
00:00:27,509 --> 00:00:29,719
Penny. Penny.

9
00:00:29,886 --> 00:00:31,716
(Penny:)Hey, Sheldon.

10
00:00:33,431 --> 00:00:36,471
- It's 11 a.m.
- I know. You're safe.

11
00:00:37,018 --> 00:00:39,018
(Sheldon:)This package came
while you were at work.

12
00:00:39,187 --> 00:00:40,857
(Penny:)Great, my rhinestones. Thank you.

13
00:00:41,022 --> 00:00:42,022
- Excuse me.
- What?

14
00:00:42,190 --> 00:00:44,190
(Sheldon:)You have to sign this.

15
00:00:44,359 --> 00:00:45,399
(Penny:)What is it?

16
00:00:45,568 --> 00:00:49,198
(Sheldon:)When I signed for the package, I was
deputized by the United Parcel Service...

17
00:00:49,364 --> 00:00:53,034
(Sheldon:)...and entrusted with its final delivery.
I need you to acknowledge receipt...

18
00:00:53,201 --> 00:00:57,021
(Sheldon:)...so that I'm fully indemnified
and no longer liable.

